  <content>
  <section><title>Cool Down Activity</title>
<para>Graphing technology should not be used in this cool down.
</para>
<title>Student Activity</title>
<para>Use this linear equation to answer questions 1 - 2.</para>
<para> \(\left\{\begin{array}{c}2x+\frac12y=7\\6x- \frac12y=5\end{array}\right.\)</para>
<div class="os-raise-ib-pset" data-button-text="Check" data-content-id="6a4f62a6-3514-4990-80d3-bb9ece07a4b5" data-fire-learning-opportunity-event="eventnameY" data-fire-success-event="eventnameX" data-retry-limit="0" data-schema-version="1.0">
  <!--Q#1.-->
  <exercise data-content-id="6b5fdee3-467c-42a4-b98d-d5e30434c8e9" data-problem-type="dropdown" data-solution="Adding the two equations" data-solution-options="[&quot;Adding the two equations&quot;, &quot;Subtracting one from the other&quot;]">
    <problem>
      <para> Which would be a more helpful method for solving the system? </para>
      </problem>
    <solution>
      <para>Correct! The answer is to add the two equations.</para>
    </solution>
    </exercise>
  <!--END QUESTION.-->
  <!--Do not edit below line.-->
  <solution>
    <!-- INSERT ANY VALID HTML HERE -->
  </solution>
  <div class="os-raise-ib-pset-encourage-response">
    <!-- INSERT ANY VALID HTML HERE -->
  </div>
</div>

<!--Q#2-->
<exercise>
  <problem>
    <para> Explain or show how you know. </para>
    </problem><solution>
    
    <para>Enter your answer here:</para>
  <para>Compare your answer:</para>
    <para>Your answer may vary, but here is a sample. \(\frac12y + − \frac12y = 0\), so adding the equations would eliminate the \(y\)-variable and enable solving for \(x\).</para>
  </solution></exercise>
<!--Interaction End -->

<para>Solve the system without graphing to answer questions 3 – 5.</para>

<!--Q#3-->
<exercise>
  <problem>
    <para> Identify the \(x\) coordinate of the solution. </para>
    </problem><solution>
    
    <para>Enter your answer here:</para>
  <para>Compare your answer:</para>
    <para>\(\frac32\) or equivalent</para>
  </solution></exercise>
<!--Interaction End -->

<div class="os-raise-ib-pset" data-button-text="Check" data-content-id="524fa8b7-f470-40b2-af10-f2916c596ede" data-fire-learning-opportunity-event="eventnameY" data-fire-success-event="eventnameX" data-retry-limit="0" data-schema-version="1.0">
  <!--Q#4-->
  <exercise data-content-id="ed1b5c81-1750-469d-8d13-0383aa66fb24" data-problem-comparator="integer" data-problem-type="input" data-solution="8">
    <problem>
      <para> Identify the \(y\) coordinate of the solution. </para>
      <para>Enter your answer here.</para>
    </problem>
    <solution>
      <para>Correct! The answer is 8. </para>
    </solution>
    </exercise>
  <!--END QUESTION.-->
  <!--Do not edit below line.-->
  <solution>
